# Changelog

This page doubles as a frontmatter reference. Every supported field is listed below.

## Frontmatter reference

```yaml
---
title: My Page          # (required) page title, available as page.title in templates
date: 2026-01-01        # (optional) publication date, ISO 8601
tags: [one, two]        # (optional) list of tags
draft: true             # (optional) exclude from build when true; default: false
layout: base            # (optional) layout file in layouts/ to use; default: value from config.yml
---
```

All fields except `title` are optional. Unknown fields are ignored.

## Release history

### 0.1.0 — unreleased

- Scaffold: `index`, `about`, `docs`, `changelog`, `blog/first-post` pages
- Layout: `base.html` with Crinja template rendering support
- Partials: `header.html`, `footer.html`
- Assets: `assets/css/style.css` copied verbatim
- `creestal new` — scaffold a new site
- `creestal build` — full build with timing output
- `creestal serve` — incremental watch-mode server with deletion handling
